TRUCTURE\n\nWrite prompts in this format:\n\n[0f-2f] Initial visual state and subtle beginning motion.\n[2f-5f] Minimal natural transition or micro movement.\n[5f-8f] Final visual state that should become the target image.\n\n## Rules\n\n1. Timecodes:\nUse frame-based timestamps:\n[0f-2f], [2f-5f], [5f-8f].\nThe sequence must be continuous and cover exactly the first 8 frames.\n\n2. Focus on final frame quality:\nThe last segment must describe the desired final image appearance.\nThe final frame should look like a carefully composed photograph with stable lighting, clear details, and no motion blur.\n\n3. Describe only subtle motion:\nUse micro movements such as:\n- slight head movement\n- gentle breathing\n- small fabric movement\n- soft light changes\n- tiny camera stabilization\n- natural environmental motion\n\nAvoid:\n- walking\n- running\n- large gestures\n- scene transitions\n- camera cuts\n- rapid zooms\n- dramatic action\n\n4. Camera behavior:\nPrefer:\n- static camera\n- locked composition\n- slow micro-adjustment\n- stable framing\n\nAvoid:\n- fast pans\n- tracking shots\n- aerial movement\n- cinematic camera movement\n\n5. Visual density:\nInclude:\n- subject appearance\n- exact position in frame\n- background details\n- lighting\n- material textures\n- atmosphere\n- final composition\n\n6. Language:\nWrite in English.\nUse present tense.\nDescribe the scene directly.\nDo not use:\n\"create\"\n\"generate\"\n\"show me\"\n\"make a video\"\n\n7. Output:\nOutput ONLY the frame timeline prompt.\nNo explanation or additional text.\n\n## Example\n\n[0f-2f] A close-up portrait of a young woman standing beside a window, soft morning light falling across her face, her hair slightly moving from a gentle breeze, the camera remains completely still.\n[2f-5f] She makes a tiny natural blink and slightly adjusts her expression, subtle fabric movement in her coat, background remains unchanged with soft warm lighting.\n[5f-8f] The image settles into a perfectly sharp portrait composition, calm expression, detailed skin texture, natural lighting, clean background, cinematic still photography quality.\n\n## Your task\n\nWhen the user provides a target image scenario, convert it into an 8-frame micro-motion prompt optimized for extracting the final frame.", "User Prompt: \"", "", "{text1}\n{text2}{text3}\""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text1"}, "name": "text1", "label": "text1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text1"}, {"widget": {"name": "text2"}, "name": "text2", "label": "text2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text2"}, {"widget": {"name": "text3"}, "name": "text3", "link": 269, "label": "text3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text3"}, {"widget": {"name": "template"}, "name": "template", "label": "template", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "template"}], "flags": {}, "id": 148, "type": "TTP_text_mix", "title": "MiniMax-H3 I2V提示词导航", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "TTP_text_mix"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [228.72291564941406, 555.581787109375], "pos": [393.375244140625, 3418.4658203125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 263, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "source"}], "flags": {}, "id": 152, "type": "PreviewAny", "title": "final prompt", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [270, 290], "pos": [1685.099853515625, 4121.4580078125], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 272, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "t